{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263snJ2j8pux1795667025.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港二手樓價結束連續兩個月升勢。</p><p></p><p>差餉物業估價署公布，10月份私人住宅售價指數，按月回落百分之0.5，與去年同期比較升百分之8.1。今年以來樓價累升百分之6.3。</p><p></p><p>各類面積單位均錄得跌幅。其中430至752平方呎跌幅較大，按月下跌百分之0.7。1,076平方呎以上兩個類別，跌幅均為百分之0.3。</p><p></p><p>10月份租金指數按月升百分之0.4，連升12個月兼再創紀錄新高，與去年同期比較升百分之6.6。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:40:51.336331+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:57:18.598217+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T04:34:01.683682+00:00","content_hash":"19b560b15dfe3bae9718d5c282838f1967a0d424eb9a3975b75e1e235608978d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:40:51.336331+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}